OL,3,CHundreds to be rehoused as Portsmouth
OL,4,Ccouncil closes four tower blocks
OL,6,FITV News Meridian's Derek Johnson
OL,7,Freports on the residents who face
OL,8,Fmoving out of their homes
OL,10,FHundreds of residents in Portsmouth
OL,11,Fwill have to be rehoused after the
OL,12,Fcity council decided to close four
OL,13,Ftower blocks.
OL,15,FTipton House, Edgbaston House, Barkis
OL,16,FHouse and Nickleby House in Buckland
OL,17,Fand Somerstown need to be strengthened.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
