OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786358877
OL,3,CHundreds to be rehoused as Portsmouth
OL,4,Ccouncil closes four tower blocks
OL,6,FAt the moment they're still deemed
OL,7,Fhabitable but the safety work will
OL,8,Ftake time and cost millions, so now
OL,9,Fresidents will be re-housed.
OL,11,FConstruction work is due to take place
OL,12,Fnext year and be completed by 2030.
OL,14,FPeople share their views on the
OL,15,Frehousing plan
OL,17,FCouncillor Darren Sanders, Cabinet
OL,18,FMember for Housing and Tackling
OL,19,FHomelessness, said:
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786358877
OL,3,CHundreds to be rehoused as Portsmouth
OL,4,Ccouncil closes four tower blocks
OL,6,F"I know from listening to people in
OL,7,Fthe blocks that some want to move,
OL,8,Fwhile others are very worried. This is
OL,9,Fthe least- worst option, the
OL,10,Falternative would mean residents would
OL,11,Fhave to leave their home for a couple
OL,12,Fof years while work was done.
OL,14,F"Doing it gradually, with a dedicated
OL,15,Fteam to support residents every step
OL,16,Fof the way and financial compensation
OL,17,Ffor being forced to move, minimises
OL,18,Fthe worries people naturally will have.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786358877
OL,3,CHundreds to be rehoused as Portsmouth
OL,4,Ccouncil closes four tower blocks
OL,6,F"The team will work closely with each
OL,7,Fhousehold to understand their
OL,8,Findividual needs, answer questions and
OL,9,Fprovide practical support throughout
OL,10,Fthe process.
OL,12,F"I also heard about the many community
OL,13,Factivities that go on. I want to make
OL,14,Fsure these continue during this
OL,15,Fprocess."
OL,17,FPeople living on the top floors of the
OL,18,Fblocks will be added onto the housing
OL,19,Fwaiting list from the top floors
OL,20,Ffirst, before subsequent floors follow.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
