FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786358877
OL,3,CHundreds to be rehoused as Portsmouth
OL,4,Ccouncil closes four tower blocks
OL,6,FThe council says rehoming will take
OL,7,Fplace once the authority has agreed
OL,8,Fwith the resident on a suitable
OL,9,Falternative.
OL,11,FThe development comes as work
OL,12,Fcontinues on increasing the supply of
OL,13,Faffordable homes in Portsmouth, with
OL,14,Fone scheme in the pipeline set to
OL,15,Fdeliver 175 new council homes for
OL,16,Fsocial rent.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/5
